<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Pharmaceutical Product hiked.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Pharmaceutical Product hiked.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst John Kreger said he upgraded Pharmaceutical Product Development Inc to focus buy from buy.</p>
<p>--&quot;PPD continues to languish near recent lows with a forward P/E multiple of 29 times,&quot; Kreger said.</p>
<p>--Shares in the clinical research services concern were off 3/8 to 24-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
